{'symbol': 'GE', 'date': '2021-04-21 03:00:00', 'title': 'GE AND HITACHI ABB POWER GRIDS SIGN LANDMARK AGREEMENT TO REDUCE ENVIRONMENTAL IMPACT IN THE ELECTRICAL TRANSMISSION INDUSTRY', 'text': "PARIS & ZURICH--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #GEGRID--GE RENEWABLE ENERGY'S GRID SOLUTIONS BUSINESS (NYSE: GE) AND HITACHI ABB POWER GRIDS LTD. ANNOUNCED TODAY A NON-EXCLUSIVE, CROSS-LICENSING AGREEMENT RELATED TO THE USE OF AN ALTERNATIVE GAS TO SULFUR HEXAFLUORIDE (SF6) USED IN HIGH VOLTAGE EQUIPMENT. THIS FLUORONITRILE-BASED GAS MIXTURE HAS A SIGNIFICANTLY REDUCED IMPACT ON THE ENVIRONMENT COMPARED TO SF6. UNDER THIS LANDMARK AGREEMENT ANNOUNCED JUST BEFORE EARTH DAY 2021 BETWEEN TWO GLOBAL LEADERS IN POWER TECH"}